  "system": {
    "identifier": "yoton-lava-release-rubber-wall-enhancement",
    "description": "<p>You slam your hands onto the ground where rubber erupts from the ground directly in front of you. The wall is 15 feet tall, 15 feet wide, and 10 feet thick. The wall is an Earthen Artifact, with an AC equal to your Ninjutsu save DC, 4d10+15 hit points, resistance to piercing and slashing damage, with immunity to bludgeoning damage.</p>\n<p>If this wall is anchored to another structure, such as a wall or tree, the wall and the structure it is attached to gains 15 additional hit points.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, and the Barriers hit points by 1d10.</p>",
